    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step out of the frame entirely\"... that's a really heavy thing to say. you make it sound like there's some kind of relief in just... not being here. like it's a logical choice or something. it's just hard to see any other way to get that peace when every day feels like a struggle to even exist.",
